  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner Identification to Gagauzia: Silba and Youth of Gagauzia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Silba Dialogue we are working to establish a new partnership with Youth of Gagauzia in Southern Moldova. Our two groups met during the DUF Moldova Explore 2024, where Silba visited Comrat Youth Center where Youth of Gagauzia resides. We wish to conduct a Partner Identification in August 2024 to further explore our partnership. The aim is to have more time together to explore the possible match between us. Our hope is to make dialogue activities together in a possible future project.</narrative>
  </description>
